    Hindi (hi) — NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW BEFORE RELEASE.

    Translated without a native speaker. The terminology choices worth checking
    first, because they repeat everywhere:
      · "request"   → "ऑर्डर"     (what a shop counter actually says, over the
                                   more formal "अनुरोध")
      · "delivered" → "दे दिया"
      · "pending"   → "बाकी"
      · "prescription" → "पर्चा"

    Brand and protocol names (MedQueue, WhatsApp, SMS, +91) are deliberately
    absent so they fall back to values/strings.xml untranslated.
-->
